{
 "_comment": "Ask set for the opt-in chat eval (assets/agent/chat-eval.eval.ts). expect: calls/forbid = tool runs whose arguments contain the given ones ($oneOf, $has, $re, $gte); noChange = no view-changing tool succeeded; answer/answerNot = final text; choose = a local ambiguous result offering the options; clarify = a question back, no change; anyOf = alternatives. on = layers switched on at the start of the ask (the mock view otherwise starts at the registry defaults); mock = scripted model turns for the mocked mode (default: built from the first expectation).",
 "asks": [
